sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor Op as Operator
  participant UI as React console (Identify)
  participant API as FastAPI scan route
  participant Jobs as JobRunner
  participant Pipe as Detector and tracker
  participant Buf as Track buffers
  participant Br as Face, gait and appearance branches
  participant Gal as Gallery
  participant Fus as Fusion
  participant Repo as WatchlistRepository
  Op->>UI: Upload CCTV video
  UI->>API: POST /api/scan
  API->>Jobs: Submit scan job
  API-->>UI: Job id
  Jobs->>Repo: load_gallery()
  Repo-->>Jobs: Active people and templates
  loop Every frame
    Jobs->>Pipe: Detect people and update tracks
    Pipe-->>Jobs: Tracks with boxes
    Jobs->>Buf: Add each track's crop
    opt Track has 5 or more observations and 15 frames passed
      Jobs->>Br: Embed best crops and the gait ring
      Br-->>Jobs: Probes, or the reason each signal refused
      Jobs->>Gal: rank(probes, strategy)
      Gal->>Fus: Calibrate and fuse for each person
      Fus-->>Gal: Fused score, weights, withheld signals
      Gal-->>Jobs: Best candidate
      Jobs->>Jobs: Keep if score is at least 0.55 and best so far
    end
  end
  Jobs->>Repo: record_match() once per matched track as PENDING
  UI->>API: GET /api/jobs/job-id until done
  API-->>UI: Findings with scores and what did not count
  UI-->>Op: Results, queued for review
